<SiteLayout title="Community News & School Events | Growing Kids" description="Explore Growing Kids school celebrations and published community stories from across Northern Indiana." breadcrumbs={[{name:'News and Events',path:'/company-news-events/'}]}><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Good Things Happen Together</h1><p class="intro">Growing Kids school celebrations bring children, families and teachers together. Explore our recurring events and the published stories of our involvement in Northern Indiana communities.</p></div></section><section class="section sage"><div class="wrap"><h2>A year of reasons to gather.</h2><p>Dates and activities come from your center. These are the recurring celebrations described on the current Growing Kids events page.</p><div class="day-rhythm"><article><h3>Spring Fling</h3><p>Games, family activities and an Easter egg hunt bring the school community together.</p></article><article><h3>Summer Cookout</h3><p>A summer gathering with food, games and time with other Growing Kids families.</p></article><article><h3>Halloween Funhouse</h3><p>Costumes, activities and crafts give children and families a reason to celebrate together.</p></article><article><h3>Christmas Program</h3><p>Families gather to watch children share songs and enjoy memories from the school year.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>From our community archive.</h2><p>These published clippings are part of Growing Kids’ history, rather than announcements of upcoming events.</p><ul class="link-list">{news.map(d=><li><a href={d.path}>{d.title} · PDF</a></li>)}</ul><p><a href="/community-involvement/">Our community involvement</a> · <a href="/team/">Meet Growing Kids</a> · <a href="/locations/">Find your center</a></p></div></section></SiteLayout>
